2026-09-23  Jörgen Johansson

	* library/explicit_bzero.c: Clarified the documentation
	explaining why explicit_bzero() must remain an out-of-line
	function.

	* library/bcopy.c: Corrected the revision history by adding the
	missing revision 1.1 entry for the CPU-specific implementations
	and renumbering the later count-guard update from 1.1.1.2 to
	1.2.

	* library/lseekw.c, library/start.S, include/unistd.h: Completed
	the removal of the obsolete lseekw() compatibility wrapper by
	removing its implementation, library vector and public
	declaration.

	* BUGS: Removed the AF_UNIX datagram, connection-timeout and
	socket-option entries. These describe planned implementation
	work already covered by TODO, rather than bugs without an
	obvious solution.

2026-09-21  Jörgen Johansson

	* library/unvis.c: Reject incomplete escape sequences at end of
	input in strunvis() and strnunvis() instead of silently
	accepting them.

	* library/select.c: Corrected the revision history by removing
	the incorrect statement that revision 1.15 introduced a
	68000/68010 inline-assembly scanner.

2026-09-13  Jörgen Johansson

	* ixemul.library: Development for version 80.

	Major work includes new libc/POSIX/BSD interfaces, AF_UNIX
	stream sockets, poll(), clock interfaces, allocator
	improvements, extensive TTY/PTY work, descriptor and close
	lifetime fixes, select() rework, string/memory optimizations,
	stdio correctness fixes, filesystem and pathname fixes, socket
	hardening and numerous m68k-specific correctness and performance
	improvements.

	Detailed changes, dates and implementation notes are recorded in
	the revision comments of the individual source files.

